        "original_id": "49112a95-7f80-5624-b6d1-fbd47a29a7d4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Robinsons-May; The May Department Stores Company; Federated Department Stores; Macy's, Inc.\n- Places: Simi Valley Town Center\n\nFacts:\n- The May Department Stores Company was founded by David May in 1877.\n- On August 30, 2005, Federated Department Stores took over The May Department Stores Company.\n- In 2005, The May Department Stores Company merged with Federated Department Stores, which is now Macy's, Inc.\n- In 2005, Simi Valley Town Center opened with Macy's and Robinsons-May as anchor stores.\n- Robinsons-May was a subsidiary of The May Department Stores Company until Federated Department Stores acquired that company on August 30, 2005.",
